/* The evolving bubble (bubble.c: CONDITION_ICON_EVOLVING), once as the partner starts to evolve (main/evl.c:
   tickEvoSequenceLoading): the game gives #field-partner-bubble the class "evolving" and its frame (1 to 51), the
   balloon grows and bursts as the need bubble's and the icon plays its four pictures by the frame count
   (CONDITION_EVOLVING_FRAMES[frame % 19]: the first on 0 to 5, then 6 and 7, 8 and 9, and 10 to 18). The full
   pictures sit by their pivot (8, 26) as the meal; the first, the bottom half only (pivot (8, 18), 8 high), 13 pixels
   under the balloon's top, so their bottoms meet. */
#field-partner-bubble .need-icon.evolving { display: block; }
#field-partner-bubble.frame-1 .need-icon.evolving, #field-partner-bubble.frame-2 .need-icon.evolving,
